     2238     in frame Dialog-Frame .
     2239   end.
     2240   if (p-list-mode = "script-name") then do:
     2241     hide
     2242     f-script-name
     2243     in frame Dialog-Frame .
     2244   end.
     2245   run Openbr in this-procedure ( input yes, input no, input '':U).
     2246   END PROCEDURE.
     2247   PROCEDURE Openbr :
